WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:37.110
Frustrated by losing my partner, Haga provoked me into a duel.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:41.950
Unable to hold back my emotions, I still defeated Haga.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:47.220
But this won't help me get my partner back.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:54.780
The runaway train derailed, dropping us into the valley below.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:02:01.700
Battle!  Two Yugis

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.950
I don't sense the Nameless Pharaoh anymore.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.880
He died?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:24.820
No.  Someone is hiding the Pharaoh's presence from me.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:31.700
Then I'll be your eyes and find the Nameless Pharaoh for you.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.140
My other self!

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.380
Partner!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.320
Partner!

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:56.730
I trust you, my other... self.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.190
Partner!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.160
A dream?  Didn't I...

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.640
Anzu!

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.700
Where are we?  We're alive?

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:24.880
Anzu!

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:30.950
What?

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.260
Stop it, Sunny!

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:34.690
Don't be rude to our guests!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:37.860
Who are you?

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.890
I'm Chris.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.140
And this is Sunny.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.870
I'm glad you're okay.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.570
It's a miracle you're not hurt from that fall.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:06.360
You're awake.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.890
Who are you?

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.420
My name is Ironheart.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.530
I'm the guardian of this valley.

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:15.200
I believe these belong to you.

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:21.340
You have a very unique card.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:28.900
I can't use this card anymore.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.610
Yugi...

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.780
Then I'll hold it for you.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:35.280
Where's Haga?

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:39.960
Did you see a boy with glasses and bobbed hair?

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:43.240
I took him to the town below the hill.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:47.640
Unlike you, he was as cold as the dead.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.400
As if his soul was taken.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.900
His soul was taken.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:56.140
It's my fault.

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:59.340
Due to the darkness in my heart.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:05.280
Long time ago, earth and men were one under love and wisdom.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:11.450
Kindness and goodwill filled the earth, and no man was lonely.

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.890
Times have changed.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:18.330
There's terrible loneliness within you.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:22.040
I lost my irreplaceable partner.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:26.700
I'm on a journey to find his soul.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:29.180
What'll you do when you find him?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.900
I don't know.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:34.040
I just want to apologize.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:37.050
Then follow me.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:54.350
Anzu!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.380
Be careful!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:03.080
Even animals lose their footing here.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.480
Up ahead is the Rock Wasteland.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.620
Rock Wasteland?

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:13.050
Fragments of a soul dwell in many things.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:17.720
In trees and flowers he touched, in the ground he tread upon.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:24.660
They say the world's souls gather at the Rock Wasteland.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.330
Including my partner's soul?

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:31.200
But there are also evil spirits.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:35.270
Once you enter, there's no guarantee you'll return alive.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.710
Will you still go?

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:42.630
I want to see my partner.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.990
Where did he go?

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.200
Is he still alive?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.940
This is the Rock Wasteland?

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:15.600
What's that?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.300
The center of the Rock Wasteland.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.880
Where your heart will be shown.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.520
I can meet my partner there?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.490
Yes.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.640
Yugi!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.890
Don't go!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:36.080
Beyond this point is a den of evil spirits.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:40.020
You can't return unless you have an iron will.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.770
Yugi...

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:13.230
What are they?

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:16.370
He's attracting souls that seek revenge.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:03.450
I trust you.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:05.120
Partner...

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:14.500
The embodiment of his heart will appear.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.070
My other self...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.810
Partner!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.480
Yugi!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.980
Partner!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.490
Why are you here?

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:39.700
I really wanted to see you.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.150
See me?

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.060
But I'm only a shell.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:50.210
Partner, I don't know what's good and bad anymore!

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:56.000
When you were with me, I knew kindness and compassion.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.350
But I now feel empty.

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:02.440
Even if I keep fighting, I'll only hurt people.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:05.280
Just like Rafael said.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:10.720
Nameless Pharaoh, there's also darkness in your heart.

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:15.820
Can you truly say you were a good Pharaoh?

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:20.140
There's great darkness in my heart.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:24.630
I'm scared to regain my memories.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:29.300
My other self, you wanted to see me so you could whine?

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:30.970
Partner?

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:36.980
Your soul returned to this world so that you could whine?

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.410
Partner?

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:43.280
I knew this day would come.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.850
When I'd have to fight you.

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.520
And that time is now!

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:49.880
W-Wait!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:53.960
If darkness has overtaken your heart...

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:56.630
...I'll defeat you here!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:02.240
You're clearly a better duelist than me.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.600
But I promise to win.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.410
And we'll part forever!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.350
Partner...

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:14.760
Get ready, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.820
Duel!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.600
Yugi...

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.480
Nameless Pharaoh.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:49.650
The stars told us that you would come.

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:54.590
And that the Nameless Pharaoh wants to redeem himself.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:57.060
Who are you?

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.410
Our hopes rest on him.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:05.930
He's the chosen savior of two worlds.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.370
Yugi is the savior?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:14.310
Only if he can overcome the darkness in his heart.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:19.750
Otherwise, his soul will wander here for eternity.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.920
Here I go!  My turn!

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:30.220
I summon a monster in defense position!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:35.100
Your turn, my other self!

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:36.880
Partner...

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.530
My turn!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:42.310
I summon Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:47.060
Gazelle attacks your defending monster!

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:55.320
The same monster?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.690
Can it be?

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:03.320
My turn!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:07.430
I summon another monster in defense position!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.620
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.870
I activate the spell card, Polymerization!

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:19.580
I Special Summon Chimera the Flying Mythical Beast!

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:24.850
And I summon Alpha The Magnet Warrior!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.860
Magnet Sword!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.490
Chimera attacks!

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.690
Chimera Impact Dash!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:45.940
We must have the exact same hand.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:51.910
So on the previous turn, he must've had Monster Reborn in his hand.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:56.420
If he used it to resurrect Gazelle, he could've summoned Chimera.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:14:00.000
A single misplay affects a duel's outcome.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.850
He's yet to have a good endgame.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.820
Due to Sangan's effect...

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.120
...I add a monster with 1500 or lower defense points from my deck to my hand.

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:11.560
Then I shuffle my deck.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.230
Partner...

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:14.900
My turn.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.100
I set a card.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.740
I activate the spell card, Card Destruction!

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.670
Partner...

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:30.190
We now have different hands.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.480
Stop, partner!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.150
There's no point for us to fight!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.220
Why do you say that?

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.310
Don't you agree?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.090
My other self, you're tough.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:51.030
You seem perfect, but I know your weakness: the darkness in your heart!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.200
Darkness in my heart?

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:57.680
Yes.  Deep in your heart, you're arrogant.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:02.980
You care too much about pride and want to do things your way.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.060
But that's not good!

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:10.120
You can't know a person by examining a single trait.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:16.420
Even if it hurts you, unless you're willing to bear the burden of your opponent's darkness...

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:19.760
...you'll never understand their pain or sorrow.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.300
Haga...  Mai...

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.400
Even Doma's Three Musketeers!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.200
You can't hear their painful screams!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:30.140
They're in pain?

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:34.110
Yes.  But currently, you can't save anyone.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:39.650
You're a coward who's afraid to get hurt!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:45.520
And you were a king that ruled over people?  Don't make me laugh!

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.960
Stop it!  I don't want to fight you!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:52.890
Why do I have this in my deck?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:58.620
I'm a mirror that reflects the darkness in your heart.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:03.270
That's why I have this card in my deck.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:05.200
That's...

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.330
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.650
Yugi used The Seal of Orichalcos?

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.690
Grandpa.

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:27.030
Let's finish this, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:28.880
Partner...

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.470
Due to Card Destruction's effect, replace your hand!

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:41.570
I activate the spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:45.540
Resurrect, Dark Magician Girl!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:52.150
And I summon Obnoxious Celtic Guard!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:58.260
Now, my monsters!

00:16:58.720 --> 00:16:59.690
Don't do it!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:02.360
Receive the power of the Orichalcos!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:15.270
Attack Alpha The Magnet Warrior!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.810
Dark Magician Girl!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.770
Black Burning!

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:34.690
Due to Chimera's effect, I summon Berfomet in defense position!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.800
It's your turn.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:45.670
I summon Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:50.110
It'll withstand Dark Magician Girl's attack.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.040
My turn!

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.680
I summon Queen's Knight in attack position!

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:02.420
I activate the spell card, Magic Formula!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:07.160
Dark Magician Girl gains 500 attack points!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:10.300
3000 attack points?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.970
Queen's Knight, attack Berfomet!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.590
And Dark Magician Girl!

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.380
Dark Burning!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.040
Celtic Guardian!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.710
Attack him directly!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:37.350
What's wrong, my other self?

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.360
Partner!  Stop!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:43.600
Not yet.  I'm only getting started.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:47.030
Is he seriously trying to defeat me?

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.700
My turn!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:54.090
I set a card and summon Giant Soldier of Stone in defense position!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:59.540
And I activate the spell card, Swords of Revealing Light!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:05.080
I can survive his attacks for three turns.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:10.360
You can't defeat me doing that!

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:12.280
My turn!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:15.060
I tribute Celtic Guardian!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.320
I summon Catapult Turtle!

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.940
Catapult Turtle?

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:29.520
Yes.  And you know Catapult Turtle's effect.

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:33.380
This will be your final turn, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:37.020
I tribute Queen's Knight!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.660
This is...

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.060
I tribute Dark Magician Girl!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.630
Take this!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:53.900
Launching Queen's Knight!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.940
Get up, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:11.820
The next strike will end you!

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:16.140
This is how I acted during that duel.

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:19.260
The darkness in my heart took over me.

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.260
This will end you!

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:26.100
I tribute Dark Magician Girl!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:31.170
Stop, partner!  Don't do it!

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.670
Launch!

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:37.400
Stop!

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.320
The trap card, Divine Wind!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:54.180
Divine Wind doubles the effect and repels it back.

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:57.500
Partner!

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.310
Yugi!

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.300
Partner!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:07.740
Partner!

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.670
Pull yourself together!

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:12.610
My other self...

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:17.550
Partner...  You did all this for me.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:22.280
My other self, don't be confused.  No matter how painful.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.250
Trust in our bond.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.050
You're not alone.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:32.100
You have friends and monsters who believe in you.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.370
Partner...

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:40.370
Even when we're apart, I'm... with...  you...

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:45.740
Partner!

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:07.250
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:15.660
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:26.750
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:36.270
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:45.300
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:50.810
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:55.990
For me to be me

00:22:55.990 --> 00:23:04.450
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:10.090
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:19.820
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:31.540
Guided by the mysterious Ironheart, Yugi faced himself in the Rock Wasteland.

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:37.980
By dueling, Yugi regained his confidence and reconfirmed their bond.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.400
You're okay now, right Yugi?

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:43.490
But things don't look good.

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:45.960
What's that monster?

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:48.840
The ghost of an Atlantean soldier?

00:23:48.840 --> 00:23:51.270
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Orichalcos Soldier

00:23:51.270 --> 00:23:52.840
Duel, standby!
